  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Partnership for Sustainable Development Data</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.To strengthen national data systems that harness and use data from across the public and private sector for timely decision making, 2.To make inclusion the norm, putting people at the centre of data production, sharing and use so that their experience is visible and the power of data can be used to fight inequality. 3.We will change the rules that govern data, fostering more participation and ensuring they are accountable to those who the data is intended to serve.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this programme is to empower decision making and accountability by improving the coverage, quality and use of data on and for the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
